# Mutation plan for a reply and a mention on `POST /api/v4/posts` — the notification pass.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/post-create-replies.plan
#
# Tab-separated: name<TAB>file<TAB>from<TAB>to<TAB>suite<TAB>filter.  `\n` becomes a newline.
#
# The parity suite performs each action on both servers and compares the rows and frames left
# behind; the store suite pins the `Threads` bookkeeping on planted rows. Two arms are not
# mutated because the stack cannot observe them: `update_participants` on the poster (the save
# already appended them) and the comment-thread mentions (every user is a CRT user under
# `always_on`). The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

